!
! building drag coeffcients
!
! 27th Symposium on Boundary Layers and Turbulence, San Diego, CA, 22-25 May, 2006: 3.5
! INFLUENCE OF BUILDINGS AND TREES ON TURBULENCE PARAMETERS IN THE URBAN
! ROUGHNESS SUBLAYER
!
! Cheryl L. Klipp*
!
! U.S. Army Research Laboratory, Adelphi, MD 20783 
! from their data roughly drbl(k)~0.1*xrai; max ~0.5 for 50% coverage
!
	i=1
