!
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
! total all co2 flux streams for turbulence calcls, etc.
! (using weight-averaged flux sources from plant & anthro canopies.)
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
!
! rdp 06 november 2015: some terms going into dwco2() appear to have been dropped. 
! this may have led to an underestimation of phortosynthesis particularly for thich canopies.
! note: the surface terms are defined at i=1 as "mathematically 'degenerate' " such that dC = C
!
       if(popdens.lt..1D-005)wco2b(1)=0D+000
       wco2(1)=wco2a(1)+wco2b(1)    
       dwco2(1)=wco2(1)
