! original meyers-paw u formulations
! vvt, calculated in trip3, is used to estimate wvv....and is used nowhere else.
!
! solve for wwco2,wtco2,ttco2,dwwco2,dwtco2 directly
! also obtain z-gradients dwwco2 & dwtco2, using centered-difference method
