!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!1!!!!!!!!!! 
! update canopy moisture contents: cmc: rcan, rcan1
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
! given le mass flux, updating rcan() (canopy moisture content)
