! albedo section. update WRF albedo based on time-varying ACASA radiative state. will feed back with WRF shortwqave (solar) radiative transfer
!hught!	XALBEDO=dble(albedok)			! fill value from WRF
        xalbedo=pr09g !xalbedo;  do nothing.
	if(iocean.eq.0)then
          if(tlux.gt..25D+002)then ! WRF: this updates update albedo to conform more to lai measured in combo with snow? etc...
